            "line": 125,
            "text": "theorem finite_time_profile_tendsto_atTop {T A E : ℝ} {error : ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hA : 0 < A) (hE : 0 < E)\n    (herror : Tendsto error (𝓝[<] T) (𝓝 0)) :\n    Tendsto (fun t => (T - t) ^ (-A) * (E + error t)) (𝓝[<] T) atTop"
